WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.869 --> 00:00:07.276
<v AI agent>Hi Dana, you've reached Contoso — I'm the automated assistant.

2
00:00:07.356 --> 00:00:09.299
<v AI agent>What can I help you with today?

3
00:00:10.723 --> 00:00:13.213
<v Dana>I was charged twice on my invoice

4
00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:15.598
<v AI agent>It sounds like Billing is the right team for that

5
00:00:15.678 --> 00:00:16.877
<v AI agent>— shall I put you through?

6
00:00:17.765 --> 00:00:18.995
<v Dana>yes please

7
00:00:19.472 --> 00:00:21.242
<v AI agent>Connecting you now to Billing.

8
00:00:25.533 --> 00:00:27.573
<v Narrator>Intent-based call routing.

9
00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:33.783
<v Narrator>Callers say what they need. The right Teams queue answers, already knowing why.

10
00:00:38.216 --> 00:00:41.236
<v Priya>I was charged for a renewal I did not order

11
00:00:41.658 --> 00:00:44.249
<v AI agent>Sorry, I want to make sure I get you to the right place.

12
00:00:44.329 --> 00:00:46.708
<v AI agent>Could you tell me a bit more about what you need?

13
00:00:47.598 --> 00:00:49.788
<v Priya>the charge on my card is wrong

14
00:00:50.205 --> 00:00:52.136
<v AI agent>It sounds like Billing is the right team for that

15
00:00:52.216 --> 00:00:53.415
<v AI agent>— shall I put you through?

16
00:00:57.404 --> 00:00:59.364
<v Caller>can I just talk to a person

17
00:00:59.777 --> 00:01:01.577
<v AI agent>Connecting you now to Reception.

18
00:01:04.734 --> 00:01:06.554
<v Marcus>yes please

19
00:01:07.023 --> 00:01:08.793
<v AI agent>Connecting you now to Billing.

20
00:01:09.275 --> 00:01:11.355
<v Marcus>no wait, the portal is down

21
00:01:11.759 --> 00:01:13.777
<v AI agent>It sounds like Support is the right team for that

22
00:01:13.857 --> 00:01:15.109
<v AI agent>— shall I put you through?

23
00:01:19.043 --> 00:01:20.568
<v AI agent>Billing is closed at the moment.

24
00:01:20.648 --> 00:01:23.137
<v AI agent>I can take a short message and make sure it reaches them

25
00:01:23.217 --> 00:01:24.983
<v AI agent>— what would you like me to pass on?

26
00:01:26.369 --> 00:01:28.759
<v Dana>please call me back about the duplicate charge

27
00:01:29.142 --> 00:01:30.749
<v AI agent>Thanks — I've passed that on to Billing,

28
00:01:30.829 --> 00:01:32.412
<v AI agent>and they'll see it when they're back.

29
00:01:33.176 --> 00:01:36.063
<v AI agent>Or use the keypad: 1 for Sales, 2 for Support,

30
00:01:36.143 --> 00:01:38.286
<v AI agent>3 for Billing, 4 for Reception.

31
00:01:41.155 --> 00:01:42.755
<v AI agent>Connecting you now to Support.

32
00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:47.293
<v Narrator>The model proposes.

33
00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:49.343
<v Narrator>The server decides.

34
00:01:53.033 --> 00:01:54.093
<v Narrator>Make it yours.

35
00:01:54.533 --> 00:02:01.083
<v Narrator>Your teams and their hours are configuration. Your coding agent can change the rest.

36
00:02:04.233 --> 00:02:06.963
<v Narrator>Run it in simulation in two minutes.

37
00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:10.390
<v Narrator>Then connect your own Teams number.
